      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i look it up online and a bunch of people say this happens all the time after long hauls. i'm pretty sure i just need to walk it off and drink some electrolytes. if i just take a high dose of aspirin or something to help with the inflammation, would that fix the calf pain and the heavy breathing? i really just want to sleep.",
